:"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-21T18:11:08Z","updated_at":"2023-04-19T04:17:56Z","closed_at":"2023-04-16T11:11:54Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-4305](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-4305)\r\n### Description\n\nWas running the following workload on RF=3 c5d.2xlarge cluster:\r\n```\r\njava -jar ~/code/yb-sample-apps/target/yb-sample-apps.jar --workload CassandraTransactionalKeyValue --nodes $NODES --num_threads_read 0 --nouuid --min_metrics_count 10000 --max_metrics_count 20000 --num_unique_keys 10000000000 --num_writes 10000000000 --drop_table_name test --num_threads_write 256\r\n```\r\nAnd got this error after few hours:\r\n```\r\n7020923 [Thread-172] INFO com.yugabyte.sample.apps.AppBase  - Caught Exception:\r\ncom.datastax.driver.core.exceptions.InvalidQueryException: Execution Error. The tablet is shutting down\r\nBEGIN TRANSACTION  INSERT INTO test (k, v) VALUES (:k1, :v1);  INSERT INTO test (k, v) VALUES (:k2, :v2);END TRANSACTION;\r\n                          ^^^^\r\n (ql error -300)\r\n        at com.datastax.driver.core.exceptions.InvalidQueryException.copy(InvalidQueryException.java:50)\r\n        at com.datastax.driver.core.DriverThrowables.propagateCause(DriverThrowables.java:35)\r\n        at com.datastax.driver.core.DefaultResultSetFuture.getUninterruptibly(DefaultResultSetFuture.java:312)\r\n        at com.datastax.driver.core.AbstractSession.execute(AbstractSession.java:58)\r\n        at com.yugabyte.sample.apps.CassandraTransactionalKeyValue.doWrite(CassandraTransactionalKeyValue.java:140)\r\n        at com.yugabyte.sample.apps.AppBase.performWrite(AppBase.java:778)\r\n        at com.yugabyte.sample.common.IOPSThread.run(IOPSThread.java:87)\r\nCaused by: com.datastax.driver.core.exceptions.InvalidQueryException: Execution Error. The tablet is shutting down\r\nBEGIN TRANSACTION  INSERT INTO test (k, v) VALUES (:k1, :v1);  INSERT INTO test (k, v) VALUES (:k2, :v2);END TRANSACTION;\r\n                          ^^^^\r\n (ql error -300)\r\n```\r\n\r\nLooks like request to the parent tablet that was shutting down hasn’t been retried, but error was returned back to client app.\r\n\n\n[DB-4305]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-4305?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"arybochkin","id":79331145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MzMxMTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79331145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin","html_url":"https://github.com/arybochkin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arybochkin/starred{